 +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =[1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ]+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor out ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ and we use the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta $ again. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta (1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\, \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-23897/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23897"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120081/selection/c34ddf202f20bbebb2a40f79cf5cb816d89ac60878af983d9bc2536022dfd192" :answer/id #uuid "1d57c027-5d3e-5233-ac1a-45d3e779bf9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120081/selection/5edc21a4fe6eb1c3972512f5d1c5ceec7756557dc863734a2ecda3cc544c5da1" :answer/id #uuid "a6e49a5c-8595-5882-bcf6-b9a1841dbd6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{cot}^{4}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120081/selection/e8ea7160322676d6646a90b732b017a6c491dfab31a46056a1cd22810ba857b2" :answer/id #uuid "6cd05115-33ea-5641-b961-ab838d4b1063" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120081/selection/a600f248099bfd16d67ed9a7ba2ab27fbf3a3c81843c178684634a4065633724" :answer/id #uuid "5ca6784a-2d88-5643-bebc-c50716585f51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{cot}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120081/selection/eaa78b604d5dcdc0478d761b05d2696e8dbeefb86a5b8beb64415e9e7d057d37" :answer/id #uuid "3359c34a-2318-5fa7-be17-8405de1fd41b" :answer/type :answer.type/math 