ed-solution "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74575/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74575"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74579/selection/06b1bdb9c46e668daae68c6b1ba8e5017ef43455d6ddd7de36a40b63e91f61ea" :answer/id #uuid "3ef9a9f0-4daf-5d9f-a5c7-bde6c8bcf749" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74579/selection/f84d9a468e2e93ab3360d6a071bddee79cf9443cbe04a3dee5a244201e3334f2" :answer/id #uuid "9a57b89b-3eda-5ba1-b7f6-d40046e52459" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74579/selection/89477886a7a3f14f15432ae3c6a5103ce639d60d709219f7d71351ff399e3fc3" :answer/id #uuid "bacea89d-b52f-5ee9-904d-b2cd1278e1b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74579/selection/9bb4905e8363fcdfde097c2a64570c4b2605894d7dc9e348d1cc9f6c9244d481" :answer/id #uuid "28be3ccc-344e-53af-bee2-ca81a2990ce3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\fra