n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -2}{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{2(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}}{\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74580/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74580"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
